# nousergon-lib (renamed from alpha-engine-lib at v0.60.0) provides
# setup_logging used by app.py + health_checker.py
# to attach the FlowDoctorHandler when FLOW_DOCTOR_ENABLED=1, the
# transparency.substrate_health checker invoked by the Sat SF's
# WeeklySubstrateHealthCheck state (added in alpha-engine-data 2026-05),
# and (v0.28.0, 2026-05-24) alpha_engine_lib.pipeline_status — the SF
# execution-state projection consumed by pages/25_Pipeline_Status.py for
# the pipeline-reporting-revamp arc (ROADMAP L3050).
# The [flow-doctor] extra pulls flow-doctor; no other extras are needed
# (dashboard reads S3, not ArcticDB). Public since 2026-05-03. NOTE: the
# extra MUST be hyphenated — setuptools normalizes pyproject's `flow_doctor`
# to `Provides-Extra: flow-doctor`, and older pip (e.g. the box's 22.3.1)
# does NOT normalize underscore->hyphen, so `[flow_doctor]` silently fails
# to resolve the extra (leaving a stale flow-doctor) while `[flow-doctor]`
# resolves on every pip version (PEP 685 canonical form).
# v0.43.0 (2026-05-29): transparency adds the non-fatal `degraded` status —
# activates artifact-completion Phase 1a/1c. The substrate-health check runs
# from this venv (Sat/EOD SF `pip install -r requirements.txt` then
# `python -m alpha_engine_lib.transparency`), and the updated
# transparency_inventory.yaml (pipeline_execution non_fatal + agent_decisions
# non_fatal_statuses) ships in the wheel — so this bump is the activation.
# v0.57.1 (2026-06-09): pipeline_status.registry gains the ModelZooRotation
# (L4544/L4571) + LibPinDriftCheck (L4517) + RunDailyNews SF states (+ their
# WaitFor* companions) — clears the page-25 "Registry drift" cells for them.
# v0.59.6 (2026-06-16): pipeline_status.registry gains the config#1083 model-zoo
# fan-out states (ResolveZooSpecs / TrainSpecDispatch / ModelZooSelect /
# PublishModelZooFailureImmediate) — clears the remaining page-25 drift cells
# (config#1115).
# v0.60.1 (2026-06-18): SSM-authoritative flow-doctor secret seed when deployed —
# overwrites a stale sourced FLOW_DOCTOR_GITHUB_TOKEN with the live SSM value so the
# github_issue notifier stops 403ing (config#1148).
# v0.59.7 (2026-06-16): pipeline_status.registry gains the EOD PostMarketArcticAppend
# state (+ WaitForPostMarketArcticAppend companion) — clears the last EOD-SF drift
# cell (config#1120).
# v0.73.0 (2026-06-28): fleet re-pin off the flow-doctor release candidate
# (config#647 step 3). lib <= v0.67.0 hard-pinned the flow_doctor extra to
# `flow-doctor[diagnosis,s3]==0.6.0rc6`; v0.68.0 delegated the extra to
# `krepis[flow_doctor]`, and krepis v0.5.0 floors `flow-doctor>=0.6.0,<0.7`.
# So this bump moves the dashboard's flow-doctor off rc6 onto the 0.6.0 final
# that shipped via flow-doctor#34 (tag v0.6.0, on PyPI). v0.73.0 is a strict
# superset of the pipeline_status/transparency APIs referenced above.
# v0.79.0 (2026-07-01): EPIC config#1483 consumer cutover (config#1531) --
