# test imports nousergon_lib.quant.horizon_guard (the shared ratchet
# primitive lifted to the lib on the second adoption, nousergon-lib#149,
# 0.78.0). v0.79.0 is a strict superset of both (and of everything below).
# v0.107.0 (2026-07-11, nousergon-lib#185): pipeline_status.registry's
