# flow-doctor floor (alpha-engine-config-I3226): explicit floor so the uv-compiled
# lockfile never resolves below 0.8.7. Prior to this pin, the trading box was stuck
# at 0.8.1 because boot-pull's plain `pip install -r requirements.txt` treated
# an already-satisfied floating dependency (transitively via krepis[flow_doctor]) as
# permanent. The compiled lockfile `requirements.txt` pins the exact resolved version;
# this floor ensures the next `uv pip compile` doesn't silently drop back below 0.8.7.
